msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: どうした少年よ、何か困っているようでござるが？
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_00"
msgid ""
"What's the matter, young man?\n"
"You seem to be in trouble."
msgstr "Що сталося, юначе? Схоже, ти потрапив у скруту."

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: おっと、申し遅れた。拙者の名はシシガミ＝バング。
#. JA:   この街で咎追いを生業としている。ああ、恐れることはないぞ。
#. JA:   確かに拙者は咎追い。だがあくまで正義の咎追いでござる。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_01"
msgid ""
"Oops! Excuse me, my name is Bang Shishigami. I make my\n"
"living as a vigilante. No need to be alarmed though.\n"
"I am a vigilante, but I'm a vigilante of justice."
msgstr ""
"Ой, я ж не представився. Я — Банґ Шішіґамі, місцевий\n"
"мисливець за головами. Та не бійся: я служу\n"
"справедливості."

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: ええ、少し道に迷ってしまって。ご心配ありがとうございます。
#. JA:   僕はカルル＝クローバー。こうみえても僕も咎追いなんです。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_02"
msgid ""
"I seem to have lost my way. Thanks for helping me out.\n"
"My name is Carl Clover. I may not look like it, but I too\n"
"am a vigilante."
msgstr ""
"Так, я трохи заблукав. Дякую, що турбуєтеся. Мене звати\n"
"Карл Кловер. Може, так і не скажеш, але я теж мисливець\n"
"за головами."

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: あ、つまりあなたは先輩にあたるわけですね。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_03"
msgid "I guess that makes you my role model."
msgstr "А, отже, ви, виходить, мій старший колега."

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: なんと、まことか！幼き身ながら苦労しているのでござるな！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_04"
msgid "No kidding! That must be tough for a man your age."
msgstr ""
"Оце так, невже?! У такому юному віці тобі вже доводиться\n"
"нелегко!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: とんでもありません。
#. JA:   それにしても、僕初めて忍者さんを見ました！
#. JA:   是非先輩の技を拝見して今後の参考にしたいのですが。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_05"
msgid ""
"Oh no, it's not that bad. I have to admit, I've never seen a\n"
"ninja until now! If you don't mind, I'd love to see one of\n"
"your techniques for future reference."
msgstr ""
"Та що ви. До речі, я вперше бачу справжнього нінджю!\n"
"Дуже хотів би поглянути на прийоми старшого колеги —\n"
"мені це знадобиться в майбутньому."

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: おおおお！！何と礼節をわきまえ、向上心に溢れた少年よ！！！
#. JA:   よし、拙者が先輩、いやアニキとして胸を貸してやろう！！！
#. JA:   手加減は無用だ、本気でかかってくるでござる！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_06"
msgid ""
"Oh, ho! Such a well-mannered young man! All right, as a\n"
"role model—or better yet, a big brother—I'll allow you to\n"
"practice your moves on me!"
msgstr ""
"О-о-о!! Який вихований і спраглий до знань юнак!!! Гаразд,\n"
"як твій старший колега — ні, як старший брат — я стану\n"
"твоїм суперником!!! Не стримуйся, нападай у повну силу!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 大変参考になりました、ありがとうございますバング先輩。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_07"
msgid "That was very helpful. Thank you so much, Mr. Bang."
msgstr "Це було дуже повчально. Дякую за науку, пане Банґу."

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: ぜ～ひぃ～ぜ～ひぃ～、
#. JA:   お、おうとも、また何かあったら、ぜ～ひぃ～ぜ～ひぃ～、
#. JA:   遠慮なくいうでござる……ぜ～ひぃ～ぜ～ひぃ～。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_08"
msgid ""
"Haah...haah...\n"
"O-Oh yeah...if you need anything at all...haah...\n"
"don't hesitate to ask me, all right? Haah...haah..."
msgstr ""
"Ху-у... Ху-у... А-авжеж. Якщо ще щось знадобиться... Ху-у...\n"
"Ху-у... Не соромся казати... Ху-у... Ху-у..."

#. Key: ArcEveCA01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 姉さん、よかったね。
#. JA:   とても面白いものが見られたよ……ふふ。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA01_09"
msgid ""
"Didn't you have a good time, Sis?\n"
"It was fun, wasn't it? ...Heheh."
msgstr ""
"Сестро, як нам пощастило. Ми побачили щось дуже\n"
"цікаве... Хе-хе."

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: あっ、アナタ、ちょっと待って！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_00"
msgid "Ah! Excuse me, please wait!"
msgstr "Агов, ти! Зачекай!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: はい、何でしょうか？
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_01"
msgid "Ah, yes?"
msgstr "Так, у чому річ?"

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: まさかそれ「ニルヴァーナ」。なぜそれがこんな所に……。
#. JA:   アナタ、一体どこでそれを手に入れたの？
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_02"
msgid ""
"Is that Nirvana? Why is it here...?\n"
"Where did you get it?"
msgstr "Невже це Нірвана? Чому вона тут?.. Де ти її взяв?"

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 皆、姉さんのことをそう呼ぶんですね。
#. JA:   あなたは、姉さんのこと知っているんですか？
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_03"
msgid ""
"Everyone calls my sister that.\n"
"Do you know her?"
msgstr "Усі чомусь так називають мою сестру. Ви її знаєте?"

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: え、その、それは――ごめんなさい、いえないの。
#. JA:   でも、このままではあなたの身が危ないわ。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_04"
msgid ""
"Eh, uh... I'm sorry, but I really can't tell you...\n"
"All I can say is that if you keep this up, something bad is\n"
"going to happen."
msgstr ""
"Ем, це... Вибач, я не можу сказати. Але якщо так\n"
"триватиме, тобі загрожує небезпека."

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: どうして大人の人って何でも隠そうとするんでしょうか。
#. JA:   ねぇ、姉さん。この人は何か色々と知っているみたいだよ？
#. JA:   なのに教えてくれない……悲しい？うん、そうだね、許せない。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_05"
msgid ""
"Why do grown-ups always hide things? Hey, Sis, this lady\n"
"knows something, doesn't she? But, she won't tell me...\n"
"Sad? Yeah, you're right. This is unacceptable."
msgstr ""
"Чому дорослі завжди все приховують? Сестро, ця пані\n"
"багато знає, але мовчить... Тобі сумно? Так, цього не\n"
"можна пробачити."

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: この子……。
#. JA:   狂気を呼ぶ機神「アークエネミー・ニルヴァーナ」。
#. JA:   博士のいっていた事は本当みたいね。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_06"
msgid ""
"Poor boy... Deus Machina Nox Nyctores Nirvana...the\n"
"machine that causes madness... It would appear that\n"
"what the professor said was right..."
msgstr ""
"Цей хлопчик... Арк-Енемі «Нірвана» — механічне\n"
"божество, що навіює божевілля. Схоже, професорка казала\n"
"правду."

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: くっ、うっ、くあっ、や、やめなさ……い。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_07"
msgid "Guh, argh, guah, s...stop..."
msgstr "Кх... Ах... Кха... П-припини..."

#. Key: ArcEveCA02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: あ、まだ気を失わないで下さい。
#. JA:   ……やっぱり大人になんかたよっちゃ駄目だ。姉さん、行こう？
msgctxt "ArcEveCA02_08"
msgid ""
"Oh, please don't lose consciousness yet.\n"
"...I knew it. Counting on grown-ups is never a good idea.\n"
"Can we go now, Sis?"
msgstr ""
"О, будь ласка, ще не непритомнійте. ...Я так і знав: не\n"
"варто покладатися на дорослих. Сестро, ходімо?"

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: ほう、機神か。久しいな。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_00"
msgid "Hm, is it you, Deus Machina? It's been a long time..."
msgstr "О, механічне божество. Давно не бачилися."

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 失礼ですが、どちら様ですか？
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_01"
msgid "I'm sorry, but do I know you?"
msgstr "Перепрошую, а ви хто?"

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 其の者の戦友と謂った所だ。
#. JA:   しかし、堕ちたな。機神ニルヴァーナよ。
#. JA:   貴様の其の手は人を殺める為の物では無かろう。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_02"
msgid ""
"Just think of me as her comrade.\n"
"You've been defiled though, haven't you, Nirvana?\n"
"Your hands were never meant for hurting people."
msgstr ""
"Можна сказати, я її бойовий товариш. Та ти занепала,\n"
"Нірвано, механічне божество. Твої руки створені не для\n"
"вбивства людей."

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 姉さんを「ニルヴァーナ」と呼ぶな。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_03"
msgid "Don't call my sister Nirvana."
msgstr "Не називай мою сестру Нірваною."

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 哀れな人形使いよ、一つ教えてやろう。
#. JA:   その機神の駆動条件、それは人の殺意。
#. JA:   憎むべき敵に対する殺意だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_04"
msgid ""
"What a pathetic puppeteer. Let me give you a piece of\n"
"advice. The driving force behind Deus Machina is a\n"
"person's killing intent. Their desire to kill."
msgstr ""
"Жалюгідний лялькарю, відкрию тобі одну річ. Умова, за\n"
"якої це механічне божество діє, — людський намір убити.\n"
"Намір убити ненависного ворога."

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 機神が人を狂わす？笑わせるな。貴様は自分の意思で、
#. JA:   機神を動かす程の殺意で、人を人間を敵と認識して居るのだ。
#. JA:   其処まで人を憎むか。之を哀れと謂わずして何と謂う？
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_05"
msgid ""
"Deus Machina drives people insane? Ridiculous.\n"
"Your desire to kill simply directs the Deus Machina.\n"
"Trying to shift the blame is pretty pathetic."
msgstr ""
"Механічне божество зводить людей з розуму? Не сміши. Ти\n"
"сам бачиш у людях ворогів і керуєш ним жагою вбивства.\n"
"Невже ти так ненавидиш людей? Жалюгідно."

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: うるさい！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_06"
msgid "Shut up!"
msgstr "Замовкни!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: お前に何がわかる！お前に姉さんの何がわかる！！
#. JA:   お前に僕の何がわかる！！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_07"
msgid ""
"What do you know!?\n"
"You don't know anything about my sister!\n"
"You don't know me either!"
msgstr ""
"Що ти знаєш?! Що ти знаєш про сестру?! Що ти знаєш про\n"
"мене?!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 解らんな、解る必要も有るまい。
#. JA:   哀れな人の子よ。絶望したお前が選んだのは悪の路。
#. JA:   ならば貴様は私の「敵」だ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_08"
msgid ""
"I certainly do not understand you, but I have no need of\n"
"understanding. What a pathetic human boy. You lost all\n"
"hope and turned to evil. That makes you my enemy!"
msgstr ""
"Не розумію. Та й потреби розуміти немає. Жалюгідний\n"
"сину людський, у відчаї ти обрав шлях зла. Отже, ти — мій\n"
"«ворог»!!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_09"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_10"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: クッ、事象干渉か！邪魔をするな化け猫め！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_11"
msgid "Gah, how dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх, втручання у причинність! Не заважай, клята\n"
"відьомська кицько!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: あれ……消えちゃった。
#. JA:   すごく強かったね、でもよかった。姉さんが、無事で。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_12"
msgid ""
"Huh? ...He's disappeared.\n"
"He was really strong. I'm glad you're safe, Sis."
msgstr ""
"Зник... Він був дуже сильний. Та головне, що з тобою все\n"
"гаразд, сестро."

#. Key: ArcEveCA03_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: ……疲れちゃったかな、ちょっとだけ。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA03_13"
msgid "...I'm a bit...tired."
msgstr "...Здається, я трохи втомився."

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 悪か……。僕はね、姉さん。姉さんのためなら何でもする。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_00"
msgid ""
"Evil, huh? ...You know what, Sis?\n"
"I will do anything for your sake."
msgstr "Зло... Знаєш, сестро, заради тебе я піду на все."

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_01"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 姉さんをこんなにした父さんを絶対見つけ出す。
#. JA:   「蒼」の魔道書を見つけ出し、必ず手に入れる。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_02"
msgid ""
"Father may have turned you into this, but I'll find him.\n"
"I'll find the Azure Grimoire, and I swear I'll take it."
msgstr ""
"Я неодмінно знайду батька, який із тобою це зробив.\n"
"Знайду Лазурний гримуар і обов’язково заволодію ним."

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_03"
msgid "Target recognized. Auto-mode: activated."
msgstr "Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано."

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: それを人が悪というのなら、僕は喜んで悪になる。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_04"
msgid ""
"If that's what mankind considers evil, I will gladly bear\n"
"that name."
msgstr "Якщо люди називають це злом, я охоче стану злом."

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……対象を障害と認識
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_05"
msgid ""
"Target identified: obstacle. Elimination protocol release\n"
"requested... Request granted."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"дозволено... Ціль визначено як перешкоду."

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: さあ……行こうか、姉さん！
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_06"
msgid "All right then... Let's go, Sis!"
msgstr "Ну що... Ходімо, сестро!"

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 対象の殲滅を開始します
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_07"
msgid "Activate elimination protocol."
msgstr "Розпочинаю знищення цілі."

#. Key: ArcEveCA04_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: なんだろうこの光？白くて、暖かい。姉さんみたいだ……。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA04_08"
msgid ""
"What is this light? It's white and warm...\n"
"It's just like my sister..."
msgstr "Що це за світло? Воно біле й тепле. Зовсім як ти, сестро..."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: へー、これが「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」だって、姉さん。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_00"
msgid "Look, Sis... This guy is called Ragna the Bloodedge."
msgstr "Ого, сестро. Отже, це Раґна Бладедж."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_01_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: それにしても、これ参考になるのかな？
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_01_0"
msgid "Is this information any good though?"
msgstr "Але чи допоможе нам цей портрет?"

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_01_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: なんで人相書きの絵って、こう
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_01_1"
msgid "I wonder why the drawings on wanted posters are"
msgstr "Чому портрети розшукуваних завжди"

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_01_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: なんともいえない絵なんだろうね？ふふっ。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_01_2"
msgid "always so terrible. Don't you, Sis? Heheheh..."
msgstr "якісь такі... дивні? Хе-хе."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_02_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: それはともかく、情報が正しければ
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_02_0"
msgid "Anyway, if this information is valid,"
msgstr "Хай там як, якщо відомості правдиві,"

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_02_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」はカグツチにいるらしいんだけど……。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_02_1"
msgid "Ragna the Bloodedge is supposed to be in Kagutsuchi right now..."
msgstr "Раґна Бладедж начебто зараз у Каґуцучі..."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_03_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: ん？わかってるよ、姉さん。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_03_0"
msgid "Hm? I know, Sis."
msgstr "Гм? Я знаю, сестро."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_03_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 無茶はしないから大丈夫、心配しないで。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_03_1"
msgid "Don't worry, I won't overdo it. I promise."
msgstr "Я не робитиму нічого необачного, не хвилюйся."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_04_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: よしっと。じゃあ、情報収集に行こう。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_04_0"
msgid "All right then, let's go collect some more information."
msgstr "Гаразд. Тоді ходімо збирати відомості."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_04_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 近衛クラスの衛士たちも何人か来てるみたいだし
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_04_1"
msgid "It looks like some people from the Guard are coming."
msgstr "Схоже, сюди прибуло й кілька вартових найвищого рівня,"

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_04_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 統制機構が関わっているとすればかなり信憑性は高いよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_04_2"
msgid "Any information from the Librarium should be reliable."
msgstr ""
"і якщо тут замішана Організація Контролю, цим\n"
"відомостям цілком можна вірити."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: もしかしたら「イカルガの英雄さん」に会えたりするかもね。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_05"
msgid "Maybe we'll run into the \"Hero of Ikaruga\" too, if we're lucky."
msgstr ""
"Може, нам навіть пощастить зустріти самого «Героя\n"
"Ікаруґи»."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_06_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 大丈夫だよ、姉さんは僕が助ける。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_06_0"
msgid "Don't worry, Sis. I'll help you."
msgstr "Не хвилюйся, сестро. Я тебе врятую."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_06_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: 必ず、「蒼」を手に入れよう。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_06_1"
msgid "Let's find the Azure grimoire."
msgstr "Ми неодмінно здобудемо «Лазур»."

#. Key: ArcEveCA05_06_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveCA_ArcEveCA05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveCA.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Arcade event: Carl
#. JA: きっと何かがわかるはずだよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveCA05_06_2"
msgid "I think it'll be the solution to our problems."
msgstr "І тоді ми напевно все зрозуміємо."
